        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okusemeza Ekiro eky'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.9.9+NUM.9.10+NUM.9.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 9:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekiya, akatumaho Isirairi na Yuda yoona, kandi yahandiikira Efuraimu na Manaase ebbaruha, naabaragira kugenda Yerusaalemu omunju ya MUKAMA, kusemeza ekiro eky'Okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, kutamu MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba omukama n'abanyoro be, n'ekitebe ky'abantu boona aba Yerusaalemu, bakaba bahanwiire kukisemeza omu kwezi kwa kabiri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaba batarukusobora kukisemeza omu kasumi kakyo, habwokuba banyakatagara abarukumara bakaba batakeeyereze, kandi n'abantu bakaba batakasorrokaniire Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entegeka egi, omukama n'ekitebe kyona, baagisiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo baaturukize ekiragiro okurangirra Isirairi yoona, okurugirra Beeri-seba, okugarukira Daani ngu, abantu bagende Yerusaalemu, basemeze ekiro eky'okwijuka Okuhingurwaho, kutamu ekitiinisa MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi; habwokuba, bakaba batakakisemezaaga bali baingi muno, nkooku kyaragiirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakwenda nukwo kurabamu Isirairi na Yuda yoona, baina ebbaruha ezirugire hali omukama n'abanyoro be, omukama nkooku akaba aragiire, nibagamba bati, “Inywe abantu ba Isirairi, mugaruke hali MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'Abburahamu, Isaka, kandi owa Isirairi, na uwe nukwo agaruke hali inywe endagalikwa abaatabukire abakama b'Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaba nka Baisenkurwinywe na bagenzi banyu abaarugireho MUKAMA Ruhanga owa baisenkurubo, ekyarugiremu, nkooku murukwerorra, na uwe nukwo kubahwerekereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaba ngumangani nka Baisenkurwinywe nkoku bakaba bali, baitu mworobere MUKAMA, mwije omu kiikaro kye ekirukwera, eki yayereze, kiikale nikyera ebiro n'ebiro, kandi muheereze, MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu nukwo aleke kubabiihirirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba obu muragaruka hali MUKAMA, abaanyagire bakazi banyu n'abaana banyu, balibagirra embabazi, babalekere bagaruke omunsi enu. Habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, munyambabazi kandi muganyizi, obu mulimuhindukira talibaima maiso.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakwenda, nukwo kugenda omu buli rubuga, baarabamu ensi yoona ey'Efuraimu na Manaase, okuhikira kimu omunsi eya Zebuluni; baitu abantu bakabasekeereza, baabagaya kandi baabateera obudoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abake ha bantu Ab'Aseeri, Manaase na Zebuluni, nubo baayebundaize, baagenda Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunsi ya Yuda, Ruhanga nubo yakizire kukorra, yatamu abantu omwoyo gumu ogw'okuhurra ekiragiro ky'omukama n'abanyoro, MUKAMA nkooku yagambire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekiro ky'Okuhingurwaho Nikikuzibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwezi kwa kabiri, abantu baingi bakeesorooleza Yerusaalemu kusemeza ekiro kikuru eky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatandika omulimo, amatambiro agakaba gali Yerusaalemu, n'agandi goona agaacumiikirirwahoga obubbaani yagaseesa, baagatwara baaganaga omu kihanga Kedirooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya ikumi na bbina eky'okwezi, kwa kabiri, nubwo baisire akataama ak'okwijuka ekiro eky'okuhingurwaho. Baanyakatagara n'Abaleevi abakaba bateyereze nkooku basemeriire, bakaswara muno, nukwo kweyereza MUKAMA; obu nubwo bakaba nibasobora kuhonga ebihongwa eby'okwokya omunju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayemerra omu biikaro byabo ebimanyiirwe, Musa omuntu wa Ruhanga nkooku yaragiire; baamiisa esagama ei baahairwe Abaleevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kitebe, habwokuba hakaba harumu baingi abakaba bateeyereze; Abaleevi nukwo kuheebwa omulimo ogw'okwita omwana gw'entaama, ogw'okwijuka okuhingurwaho habw'abo boona abakaba bataina burukwera obusemeriire kwereza MUKAMA ebyonzira byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, orucaca rw'abantu abo, abaingi omuli bo abaarugire omunsi y'Efuraimu, eya Manaase, eya Isakaara na Zebuluuni, bakaba bateeyereze, baitu bakalya obugenyi obw'okwijuka okuhingurwaho, nkooku kitaararagiirwe. Habwokuba, omukama Hezekiya, akaba abasabiire naagamba ati, “Iwe MUKAMA omurungi, oganyire omuntu wena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyakutaire omutima ha kuserra Ruhanga, MUKAMA Ruhanga owa baisenkuru, noobu araaba atahikiriize biragiro eby'okwezibwa eby'omu kiikaro ekirukwera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA, akahurra Hezekiya eki yasabire; abantu yabaganyira, tiyabakora kabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Isirairi abakaba bali Yerusaalemu, bakamara ebiro musanju, bali omu bugenyi obwokwijuka emigaati etatumbisiibwe, baina okusemererwa okutagambwa; kandi buli kiro Abaleevi na banyakatagara, baikara nibahaisaniza MUKAMA, nibamuzinira n'amaani gaabo goona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya akabaza naayekambisa Abaleevi boona, abaayolekere amagezi amarungi omu kuheereza MUKAMA. Abantu nukwo baliire bati, ebyokulya eby'obugenyi obw'ekiro kikuru, okumara ebiro musanju, nibatamba ebihongwa eby'okusaba obusinge, kandi nibasiima MUKAMA Ruhanga owa baisenkurubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma ekitebe kyona, kyaikiriza obugenyi kubwongera omumaiso; kumara ebiro musanju ebindi; nukwo baakozire, baamara ebiro musanju ebindi, nibasemererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba Hezekiya omukama wa Yuda, akaha ekitebe enimi rukumi, empaya kasanju ez'ebihongwa, abanyoro, na bo baakiha enimi rukumi, n'entaama kakumi. Baanyakatagara baingi muno, baayeyeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe eky'abantu ba Yuda kyona, banyakatagara n'Abaleevi, ekitebe kyona ekyarugire omu Isirairi, abanyamahanga abaarugire omunsi ya Isirairi, n'abaikaraga omunsi ya Yuda, baakyanganuka muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
